<div class="about-body">
  <h1 class="about-head">about</h1>
  <p>
    october tooth is where practice tapes, arrangement ideas, and half-finished
    songs go when they're recorded on a tascam 424 mkiii — usually with
    something muted on an old batman-era tv in the background.
  </p>
  <p>
    there's no fixed schedule. roughly a tape every few weeks, sometimes
    faster, sometimes not. a few of these eventually get mastered into
    proper releases — most don't, and that's fine. this is the working-it-out
    part, not the finished part.
  </p>
  <p>
    alongside the tapes: paintings, photos, playlists, and whatever else
    seems worth sharing that month. shows and releases get announced here
    too, when there are any.
  </p>
</div>

